#~ msgid "<b>Conflict Warning</b> — OptiScaler and lsfg-vk both intercept the same rendering pipeline. Running both simultaneously causes artifacts; disable one."
#~ msgstr "<b>Aviso de Conflito</b> — OptiScaler e lsfg-vk interceptam o mesmo pipeline de renderização. Executar ambos simultaneamente causa artefatos; desative um."

#~ msgid "<b>Dark Mode</b> — Force dark colour scheme regardless of the system theme."
#~ msgstr "<b>Modo Escuro</b> — força o esquema de cores escuro, independentemente do tema do sistema."

#~ msgid "<b>Detected Games</b> — Games found via Steam, Lutris and Heroic. Create a performance profile or launch directly with Gamescope."
